data: [{"type":"repo","repositoryID":42704141,"repository":"github.com/hotwired/turbo-rails","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":2397,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T19:10:30.226327Z","description":"Use Turbo in your Ruby on Rails app"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64301321,"repository":"github.com/HowieWang1121/Socratic-Education-System","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":134,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T20:14:52.952439Z","description":"我们认为，受教育不仅是义务，更是应被保障的权利。然而，社会与经济条件的差异导致了优质教育资源的分配失衡。本项目旨在弥合城乡教育鸿沟，为偏远地区的师生提供基于 FastAPI 架构的启发式教学解决方案。系统摒弃了传统的“问答式”灌输，构建了以“助产术”为核心的对话智能体，通过多轮追问诱导学生自主拆解复杂问题，实现认知升级。在教师端，系统通过动态分析学生 JSON 档案，精准识别知识盲区并提供结构化教学干预建议，辅助教师完成个性化教学决策。"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":40088616,"repository":"github.com/sachabruttin/CosmosDbExplorer","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":121,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T00:28:40.731604Z","description":"A nice client explorer for Azure Cosmos DB"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":39984696,"repository":"github.com/huginn/huginn_agent","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":132,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T19:30:49.845062Z","description":"Base for creating new Huginn Agents as Gems"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64177722,"repository":"github.com/MikeWang000000/FakeSIP","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":344,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T20:24:36.775989Z","description":"Disguise your UDP traffic as SIP protocol to evade DPI detection, using Netfilter Queue (NFQUEUE)."},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":42835538,"repository":"github.com/justjavac/versailles","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":118,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T02:03:40.664846Z","description":"凡尔赛语录","topics":["deno"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64289180,"repository":"github.com/kytmanov/obsidian-llm-wiki-local","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":829,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T22:08:44.125666Z","description":"Karpathy’s LLM Wiki, 100% local with Ollama. Drop Markdown notes → AI extracts concepts → your Obsid